  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For a &gt; b &gt; c &gt; 0, the distance between (1, 1) and the point of intersection of the lines ax + by + c = 0 and bx + ay + c = 0 is less than <math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math>.Then</p>",
