  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>a</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>y</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mtext>Point of intersection</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>,</mtext> <mfrac> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>c</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br />Now using distance formula between two points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>c</mtext><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>c</mtext><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>c</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>c</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>c</mtext><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>c</mtext> <mo>&#62;</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math></p>",
